  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "45fbf12f-a356-4b69-b798-650ca72034cb",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -16,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## TEMPLATE - Set a default error workflow on all workflows via the n8n API\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs nightly or manually to apply a default error workflow setting across workflows in an n8n instance. It loads configuration values, retrieves all workflows through the n8n API, splits and filters them, then loops through the selected workflows and updates each one while preserving its other settings. A short wait throttles API updates before the loop continues until all workflows are processed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the n8n API credentials used by the HTTP Request nodes so they can read and update workflows.\n- In the Configuration node, set n8n_base_url to your n8n instance URL and error_workflow_id to the workflow that should become the default error workflow.\n- Adjust only_fill_empty if updates should only apply to workflows that do not already have an error workflow configured.\n- Set exclusion_tag if certain workflows should be skipped based on a tag.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can change the schedule time, filtering rules, exclusion tag, or throttle delay to match your instance size and API rate limits."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9011c187-52a8-495b-baef-5e53c6731620",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        544,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## Start and configure\n\nContains the scheduled and manual entry points plus the shared configuration values that drive the API calls and filtering behavior."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4e19fd48-7810-4c4c-b02f-da07510605c2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1008,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 624,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Fetch and select workflows\n\nRetrieves workflows from the n8n API, splits the returned list into individual items, and filters down to the workflows that should be updated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c00127b5-7774-448a-a701-793cdb2a8fee",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1728,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "## Loop and finish\n\nControls batch-style iteration over the filtered workflows and routes to the completion node once there are no more workflows to process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e941d6b1-70bd-4e2f-a04b-bef30810ca85",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2208,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 464,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Update and throttle\n\nUpdates each workflow with the configured default error workflow while keeping other settings intact, then waits briefly before returning to the loop."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
